      "text": "EXPERIENCE\nPrincipal UI Engineer — Amstel Tech Solutions 03/2020 – Present\nIndustry: Software Development\n– Led engineering teams as Principal UI Engineer using JavaScript, TypeScript, React, CSS, and Docker.\n– Delivered frontend architecture improvements in the software development industry.\nSenior Frontend Developer — Zaan Web Works 01/2016 – 02/2020\nIndustry: Digital Media\n– Developed web applications as a Senior Frontend Developer utilizing JavaScript, React, Vue, HTML, CSS,\nand Jest.\n– Contributed to digital media projects across multiple teams.\nFrontend Developer — IJssel Media 06/2014 – 12/2015\nIndustry: Web Development\n– Implemented user interfaces as a Frontend Developer with JavaScript, HTML, CSS, and Jest.\n– Built responsive web pages in the web development industry."
